WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:02.101
-Welcome back.

00:00:02.101 --> 00:00:04.370
I'm here with Nicole Holofcener,
Ben Affleck, and Matt Damon,

00:00:04.370 --> 00:00:09.241
the stars of "The Last Duel,"
the writers of "The Last Duel."

00:00:09.241 --> 00:00:11.577
Thank you again for being here.

00:00:11.577 --> 00:00:14.613
You filmed a lot of this
in Ireland.

00:00:14.613 --> 00:00:16.515
It is a massive movie,
by the way.

00:00:16.515 --> 00:00:18.717
And what I love about it
is how much --

00:00:18.717 --> 00:00:21.454
I appreciate how much work
goes into movies,

00:00:21.454 --> 00:00:25.091
from writing to getting it made,
getting it produced,

00:00:25.091 --> 00:00:27.894
but then doing it, filming it,
then doing also press for it.

00:00:27.894 --> 00:00:29.662
But I know it's years
of your life.

00:00:29.662 --> 00:00:30.663
-Yeah. Yeah.

00:00:30.663 --> 00:00:32.998
-It's a lot of work.
-It's a lot.

00:00:32.998 --> 00:00:36.001
I mean, this is, you know,
a few years of work,

00:00:36.001 --> 00:00:37.103
of, like, a lot of thought

00:00:37.103 --> 00:00:38.537
and care and love
and all that stuff.

00:00:38.537 --> 00:00:41.340
I mean, and then we got
interrupted by COVID, of course,

00:00:41.340 --> 00:00:42.575
kind of halfway through, so --

00:00:42.575 --> 00:00:45.411
-Yeah, you stayed
in Ireland, right?

00:00:45.411 --> 00:00:47.313
-I did, yeah, I stayed.

00:00:47.313 --> 00:00:49.081
We shut down right when
we got to Ireland,

00:00:49.081 --> 00:00:51.251
and my family and I,
we just took a vote.

00:00:51.251 --> 00:00:53.186
We decided to stay.
And it was a great decision.

00:00:53.186 --> 00:00:55.821
We had a great time there
and kind of got absorbed

00:00:55.821 --> 00:00:57.523
into this beautiful
little community there.

00:00:57.523 --> 00:00:59.158
-Where exactly were you?
-We were in Dalkey.

00:00:59.158 --> 00:01:00.827
We were just near Dublin.

00:01:00.827 --> 00:01:02.228
And it's this great little town,

00:01:02.228 --> 00:01:05.597
and we were as lucky
as you could get, really.

00:01:05.597 --> 00:01:10.002
-I heard a story that you
FaceTimed the mayor of Dalkey.

00:01:10.002 --> 00:01:11.304
-The mayor of Dalkey,
Bono, yeah.

00:01:11.304 --> 00:01:13.072
-Bono.
-I FaceTimed him the night

00:01:13.072 --> 00:01:15.941
that my wife and I
had a few drinks.

00:01:15.941 --> 00:01:18.444
-Okay.
-It was a Friday night,

00:01:18.444 --> 00:01:22.215
and I had let the kids
dye my hair red.

00:01:22.215 --> 00:01:24.517
Like, we --
-That's what a dad does.

00:01:24.517 --> 00:01:26.885
-Yeah, I was their art project,
basically.

00:01:26.885 --> 00:01:29.655
And it was clear that
we weren't going back to work,

00:01:29.655 --> 00:01:32.358
and so then we decided --
they decided --

00:01:32.358 --> 00:01:33.726
-There's nothing
children like more

00:01:33.726 --> 00:01:34.760
than to humiliate their parents.

00:01:34.760 --> 00:01:36.262
-Than to humiliate their father,
right.

00:01:36.262 --> 00:01:37.496
-Oh, yeah.

00:01:37.496 --> 00:01:39.932
-But then they decided
that I needed a Mohawk.

00:01:39.932 --> 00:01:42.768
I don't even know --
And so they Mohawked me,

00:01:42.768 --> 00:01:44.136
and that was the night
I FaceTimed him.

00:01:44.136 --> 00:01:45.805
And he was like,
"What are you doing?"

00:01:45.805 --> 00:01:46.839
And that's what we were --

00:01:46.839 --> 00:01:48.073
-He's like,
"I'm starting a band."

00:01:48.073 --> 00:01:50.476
-Yeah, here's a picture
of Matt Damon's hair.

00:01:50.476 --> 00:01:52.312
Look at this thing.
-Oh, my God.

00:01:52.312 --> 00:01:53.512
[ Laughter ]

00:01:53.512 --> 00:01:55.481
-It's Travis Bickle.
-It's Travis Bickle.

00:01:55.481 --> 00:01:58.117
And actually the hair,
it's even more ridiculous.

00:01:58.117 --> 00:02:00.586
That's a black-and-white
that my wife took on her phone.

00:02:00.586 --> 00:02:02.588
But the hair
was actually maroon.

00:02:02.588 --> 00:02:04.757
I looked like a rooster.
I looked ridiculous.

00:02:04.757 --> 00:02:06.759
-What did Bono say
when you FaceTimed him?

00:02:06.759 --> 00:02:08.361
-He was like,
"What have you done?

00:02:08.361 --> 00:02:10.162
What is happening over there?"
-Like, "Go back to America."

00:02:10.162 --> 00:02:11.964
-Like, "Do you need help?

00:02:11.964 --> 00:02:14.033
Do we need to come help you?"
-"Shall I send someone?"

00:02:14.033 --> 00:02:18.070
-Yeah. Well, I can't thank you
enough for writing this

00:02:18.070 --> 00:02:20.006
and making this project real.
-Thanks.

00:02:20.006 --> 00:02:22.474
-And it's a great story.
People got to check it out.

00:02:22.474 --> 00:02:24.076
I want to show a clip.

00:02:24.076 --> 00:02:26.546
Here's Matt Damon and
Jodie Comer in "The Last Duel."

00:02:26.546 --> 00:02:27.947
Take a look.

00:02:27.947 --> 00:02:31.651
-You knew what would happen
to me should you lose this duel.

00:02:31.651 --> 00:02:33.152
You knew and you didn't tell me.

00:02:33.152 --> 00:02:36.789
-God will not punish those
who tell the truth.

00:02:36.789 --> 00:02:38.824
-My fate and our child's fate

00:02:38.824 --> 00:02:41.961
will be written
not by God's will,

00:02:41.961 --> 00:02:44.531
but by which old man
will die first.

00:02:49.201 --> 00:02:50.969
-How dare you speak to me
this way?

00:02:50.969 --> 00:02:52.205
-What have I to lose?

00:02:52.205 --> 00:02:53.539
I begged you
to find another way,

00:02:53.539 --> 00:02:55.341
and now I might be burned alive.

00:02:55.341 --> 00:02:57.343
-I am risking my life for you.

00:02:57.343 --> 00:02:59.912
-Mm.

00:02:59.912 --> 00:03:03.116
You are risking my life

00:03:03.116 --> 00:03:06.953
so you can fight your enemy
and save your pride.

00:03:06.953 --> 00:03:09.155
And that could render
our child an orphan.

00:03:11.624 --> 00:03:13.325
Or did you not think of that?

00:03:13.325 --> 00:03:15.828
-Nicole Holofcener, Ben Affleck,
Matt Damon.

00:03:15.828 --> 00:03:19.566
"The Last Duel"
is in theaters Friday.

